   "text": "University of Canterbury International College - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Canterbury International College\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe University of Canterbury is New Zealand's second oldest university and was founded in 1873. In 2017/18 QS World University Rankings ranked the University of Canterbury 214th overall in the world, and the third highest ranked university in New Zealand.\nUCIC offers an exclusive pathway into University of Canterbury undergraduate programs and the college is located at Alice Candy in the University of Canterbury's Ilam campus where students have access to the University's facilities and services.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:23\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 09:31\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nNew Zealand\nYearly Fees\nMax: NZ$31,810.00\nMin: NZ$23,060.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n8%\n1,760 of 23,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n2013\nCampus(es)\nChristchurch\nCountry\nNew Zealand\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S_b6RVVmXzM\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
